<div id="anp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none"><div class="notes p">
<section id="article-meta1" class="series-info"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Series information</h3>
<p>“Morphology is the Link Between Genetics and Function”: A Tribute to Ewald R. Weibel</p></section><section id="historyarticle-meta1" class="history"><p>Received 2021 Jan 11; Revised 2021 Apr 15; Accepted 2021 Apr 27; Issue date 2021 Jul 1.</p></section>
</div></div>
<div id="clp_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none">
<div>Published by the American Physiological Society</div>
<div class="p"><a href="/about/copyright/" class="usa-link">PMC Copyright notice</a></div>
</div>
